{"id":5609,"path":"/anime/5609-sweet-punishment-im-the-guards-personal-pet","linkSchemaVersion":2,"enrichmentSchemaVersion":2,"updatedAt":"2026-10-30T15:13:53.968Z","info":{"title":"Sweet Punishment: I'm the Guard's Personal Pet","synopsis":"In un prossimo futuro, la giovane impiegata Hina Saotome viene, per qualche motivo, spedita alle patrie galere nonostante sia innocente. Rinchiusa nella prigione di Kokuyoku, viene affidata all’affascinante carceriere Aki Myojin. “Non penserai di fuggire dalla prigione… o da me!?” le ripete spesso. Che ne sarà della povera Hina","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q3m3giqWWspCQyVUd1QLX2eVDff.jpg","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wOhuwhOfr1f3ZOq3oTOMXKBBJ8l.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q3m3giqWWspCQyVUd1QLX2eVDff.jpg","trailers":["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BS6XFVrMGNA"],"imdbId":"","type":"series","tags":["ONA","Terminato","Primavera","2018"],"tagKeys":{"ONA":"ONA","Terminato":"Completed","Primavera":"Spring"},"genres":["Drama","Ecchi","Hentai","Josei","Romance"],"rating":"6.8","studio":"Magic Bus","episodesCount":12,"extra":{"ids":{"malId":37320,"anilistId":101160,"crunchyId":null,"disneyId":null,"netflixId":null,"primeId":null,"anilistIds":[101160],"malIds":[37320],"anidbIds":[13806],"imdbMovieIds":[],"imdbShowIds":[],"tmdbMovieIds":[],"tmdbShowIds":[78501],"tvdbMovieIds":[],"tvdbShowIds":[345341]},"stats":{"scoreRaw":"6.81","favorites":120,"members":507,"views":469971,"episodesCountRaw":12,"episodesLength":6},"flags":{"dub":0,"alwaysHome":0},"meta":{"day":"Domenica","season":"Primavera","status":"Terminato","type":"ONA","createdAt":"2024-09-14 16:54:10","userId":2},"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-10-29T07:54:59Z","sourceDescriptors":["mal:37320"],"targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13806","scope":"R","ranges":{"1-13":"1-13"}},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"78501","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-13":"1-13"}},{"provider":"tvdb_show","